@startuml
title Batch Merchant Settlement Flow

participant Scheduler
participant SettlementService
participant TransactionDB
participant BankAPI
participant NotificationService
participant MQ

== Batch Trigger ==

Scheduler -> SettlementService: Trigger Daily Settlement

SettlementService -> TransactionDB: Fetch Pending Transactions
TransactionDB --> SettlementService: Batch Data

SettlementService -> SettlementService: Group by Merchant

loop Each Merchant
    SettlementService -> BankAPI: Initiate Transfer

    alt Success
        BankAPI --> SettlementService: Settlement Success
        SettlementService -> TransactionDB: Mark Settled
    else Failure
        BankAPI --> SettlementService: Failure Response
        SettlementService -> MQ: Publish Failure Event
    end
end

SettlementService -> NotificationService: Send Settlement Report

NotificationService -> Merchant: Settlement Summary

@enduml